<title>USA: Storm threatens shipping in Philippine Sea -WSC.</title>
<headline>Storm threatens shipping in Philippine Sea -WSC.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Mass. 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tropical Storm Fern is threatening shipping in the Philippine Sea as it slowly intensifies, private forecaster Weather Services Corporation (WSC) said on Monday.</p>
<p>Top winds could be near 70 mph by 48 hours.</p>
</text>
